  "ingredients": [
    "2 large eggs",
    "3 slices bacon, cooked and crumbled",
    "2 (8 inch) flour tortillas",
    "1 teaspoon butter, softened, or to taste",
    "cooking spray",
    "0.5 cup shredded Colby-Jack cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YbD_sXXm2XZCW2PbJltLlAmX3wQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8353109-best-breakfast-quesadilla-VAT-005-step-01-9fa4e32481524479ae5a0ef6eed87e59.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8353109/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crack eggs into a small bowl. Add crumbled bacon and whisk until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E9QOKvfnPLrgXluJcR4kbpUv2m8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8353109-best-breakfast-quesadilla-VAT-006-step-02-afb56de5e61c467aa5c1f251717f865d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8353109/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray a large skillet with cooking spray; warm over medium-high heat. Pour egg mixture into the skillet; cook and stir until eggs are set, about 5 minutes. Remove from the heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/g1wZj_yVcJbitm3XS_GjJDwfgLg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8353109-best-breakfast-quesadilla-VAT-007-step-03-d61011c514e946daaf3c1cf91628bad1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8353109/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly butter one side of each tortilla. Warm a separate, dry skillet over medium-low heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3JYA3ty-xX4zr6SpukuECfmjCn0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8353109-best-breakfast-quesadilla-VAT-008-step-04-008c3d5d1d534ee3ace173e26326285d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8353109/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place one tortilla into the warm skillet with the buttered side facing down. Spoon 1/2 of the scrambled egg mixture over one half of the tortilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NA86d8-IekAeME2uorEBrT11Pbs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8353109-best-breakfast-quesadilla-VAT-009-step-05-df91477c287d4f4da74bccdf547764f6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8353109/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle 1/4 cup Colby-Jack cheese over the egg mixture and fold the tortilla over top. Cook, turning as needed, until tortilla is toasted and crispy and cheese is melted, 2 to 3 minutes. Repeat to make second quesadilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
